  "permlink": "https://cafe.daum.net/sedu22/fNz5/67",
  "contentHtml": "<p style=\"text-align: left;\">요즘 열평형과 비열 관련 실험을 진행하면서 <br>처음으로 실험 가이드 종이를 만들어서 사용합니다!<br><br>그래서 실험하기 전 예비 탐구 시뮬레이션 보고<br>캡쳐에서 결과 저장하고</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/b9f53d1856f29e7ed6553004ba033c5250f477b8\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/b9f53d1856f29e7ed6553004ba033c5250f477b8\" data-origin-width=\"900\" data-origin-height=\"900\"></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\">가이드 보면서 블록코딩도 진행하고</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/1b17ce880ae18834d54f4cb1bd02c0a0aacf6d6b\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/1b17ce880ae18834d54f4cb1bd02c0a0aacf6d6b\" data-origin-width=\"900\" data-origin-height=\"900\"></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\">센서랑 보드 조립도 하고!</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/5f7633b52b5f559b816202ea8eda05f670259991\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/5f7633b52b5f559b816202ea8eda05f670259991\" data-origin-width=\"900\" data-origin-height=\"900\"></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\">실험 결과도 봅니다!</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/9f4986b08dc9f40668c2b2f6d3a81f613f6e02b6\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/9f4986b08dc9f40668c2b2f6d3a81f613f6e02b6\" data-origin-width=\"900\" data-origin-height=\"900\"></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\">물론 교사의 도움도 분명 필요하죠<br>그래도 확실히 진행이 수월합니다.</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/46324d8b7aaba595e58475ce22a6b72033aa5df2\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/46324d8b7aaba595e58475ce22a6b72033aa5df2\" data-origin-width=\"2992\" data-origin-height=\"2992\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/7a2a2b9d5ab80e9f0895f9c2036211a716a3fb87\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/7a2a2b9d5ab80e9f0895f9c2036211a716a3fb87\" data-origin-width=\"2992\" data-origin-height=\"2992\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/cf78e6adc58f285a90a19d5f5c01f8f4963f8cc7\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/cf78e6adc58f285a90a19d5f5c01f8f4963f8cc7\" data-origin-width=\"2992\" data-origin-height=\"2992\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/7ee09c2c081dc89399b41e2d7c95f497d7814243\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/7ee09c2c081dc89399b41e2d7c95f497d7814243\" data-origin-width=\"2992\" data-origin-height=\"2992\"></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\">그래도 확실히, 애들 입장에서도<br>교사의 설명을 놓치면 <br>다시 질문을 하고 답을 들을 때까지 기다리는 것 말고,<br>가이드를 보면서 알아서 실험을 진행하면 되니까<br>정말 정말 수업하기 편한 것 같습니다!<br>(물론, 가이드가 있어도 잘 안보기도 하죠)<br><br>특히 센서 실험에서 꼭 거쳐야하는<br>블럭 코딩이나 보드 업로드들이 많기 때문에<br>어느 정도 학생에게 친절한 가이드는 필수적이라고 생각이 드는 요즘입니다ㅎㅎ!!<br><br>[네이버 블로그] 블로그를 소개합니다.<br>쿼카쌤의 수업꾸러미 | 최효석<br><a href=\"https://m.blog.naver.com/chlgytjr111\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">https://m.blog.naver.com/chlgytjr111</a></p><div class=\"figure-open\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-ke-type=\"opengraph\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\" data-og-type=\"website\" data-og-title=\"쿼카쌤의 수업꾸러미 : 네이버 블로그\" data-og-description=\"영서중학교 과학교사(물리 전공)입니다! 항상 새로운 수업을 만들고자 합니다\" data-og-host=\"m.blog.naver.com\" data-og-source-url=\"https://m.blog.naver.com/chlgytjr111\" data-og-url=\"https://m.blog.naver.com/chlgytjr111\" data-og-image=\"http://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/cgLMij/dJMb8TB88xj/aVjJIkZTrxrckSsKLy8kq1/kakaolink40_original.jpg?width=204&amp;height=204\"><a href=\"https://m.blog.naver.com/chlgytjr111\" target=\"_blank\" data-source-url=\"https://m.blog.naver.com/chlgytjr111\"><div class=\"og-image\"><img class=\"thumb_img\" src=\"http://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/cgLMij/dJMb8TB88xj/aVjJIkZTrxrckSsKLy8kq1/kakaolink40_original.jpg?width=204&amp;height=204\" alt=\"\" xxxxonerror=\"this.src=&quot;//img1.kakaocdn.net/thumb/C200x200/?fname=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafe_image%2Fcafe_meta_image_190529.png&quot;\"></div><div class=\"og-text\"><p class=\"og-title\">쿼카쌤의 수업꾸러미 : 네이버 블로그</p><p class=\"og-desc\">영서중학교 과학교사(물리 전공)입니다! 항상 새로운 수업을 만들고자 합니다</p><p class=\"og-host\">m.blog.naver.com</p></div></a></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->"
